<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 37-1 AT LUNCH IN THIRD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 37-1 AT LUNCH IN THIRD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 37 for one wicket at lunch in reply to Australia's first innings total of 235 on the second day of the third cricket test against Australia at Old Trafford on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 235 (S.Waugh 108; D.Headley 4-72, D.Gough 3-52), England 37-1.</p>
